            "detailed_description": "Become Emma Jones, firefighter extraordinaire, tough cookie and kitten lover. Beat 10 levels of dangerous mountain terrain, improving Jones’ skills with every fluffy life saved. Strive for ever higher scores, and gain the adoration of millions of cats!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSave the kitties! You’re their only hope!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Fast, frenetic, side-scrolling fun<br />\r\n- Intuitive controls<br />\r\n- Juicy running and jumping physics<br />\r\n- Fun in short bursts, but addictive enough for longer plays<br />\r\n- Upgrade Jones with increasingly spiffy fire-fighting skills<br />\r\n- Blocky, retro visuals with just a touch of the modern<br />\r\n- Rockin' tunes",
            "about_the_game": "Become Emma Jones, firefighter extraordinaire, tough cookie and kitten lover. Beat 10 levels of dangerous mountain terrain, improving Jones’ skills with every fluffy life saved. Strive for ever higher scores, and gain the adoration of millions of cats!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSave the kitties! You’re their only hope!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Fast, frenetic, side-scrolling fun<br />\r\n- Intuitive controls<br />\r\n- Juicy running and jumping physics<br />\r\n- Fun in short bursts, but addictive enough for longer plays<br />\r\n- Upgrade Jones with increasingly spiffy fire-fighting skills<br />\r\n- Blocky, retro visuals with just a touch of the modern<br />\r\n- Rockin' tunes",
            "short_description": "A high-speed 2-button infinite running game of kitty saving and flame evading! This is the prequel to Hot Tin Roof - see where the story of Jones and Franky begins.",
